1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
One assumption can steer a whole conversation.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Abhinav wants a system that monitors industry channels and recommends the next best action.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
The assistant adds local deployment. But that requirement was never in the brief.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
With context denoising, he names the problem: remove the local deployment assumption.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,500
The saved history is updated. Each new pass builds on those edits.

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Now the chat continues, without that invented constraint.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Cleaner context. Better next replies.
